  {
    "name": "wiki",
    "title": "Wiki",
    "version": "0.1.4",
    "description": "Markdown knowledge base in the workspace repo, linked from tickets.",
    "capabilities": [],
    "first_party": true,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "slot": "nav",
        "id": "pages",
        "title": "Wiki",
        "icon": "BookOpen",
        "node": {
          "type": "stack",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "text": "# Tariff data conventions\n\nHow we name, version and review tariff data in the **Acme energy data** workspace.\n\n## Rules\n\n- One seed file per tariff table, named `tariff_<region>_<year>.csv`.\n- Every table has a `valid_from` date; never edit a past row, add a new one.\n- Changes go through a pull request with a reconciliation run attached.\n\n## Checks\n\n| Check | Where | Tolerance |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Row count | dbt test | exact |\n| Billed kWh vs finance | reconciliation | 0.1 % |\n\nSee the [dbt seeds guide](https://docs.getdbt.com/docs/build/seeds) for the loader.\n\n> Seeds are for small, slow-changing reference data only.\n\n![diagram](https://example.com/tracker.png)\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "language": "sql",
              "text": "select tariff_id, valid_from, price_per_kwh\nfrom {{ ref('tariff_ch_2026') }}\nwhere valid_from <= current_date;"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "slot": "ticket.panel",
        "id": "related",
        "title": "Related pages",
        "icon": "BookOpen",
        "node": {
          "type": "list",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "ticket.addons.wiki.pages"
          },
          "empty": "No linked pages."
        }
      }
    ],
    "package_sha256": "b7d76fb138a9d11a83fee724900e7badb09ac744fe7b9c703017da4039ee5639",
    "update": null
  },
